Remove Python 3.11-only and exact dependency pins for EasyBuild's 2025a stack.

gmx_MMPBSA 1.6.5's upstream setup.py rejects Python 3.13 and exact-pins its
scientific Python dependencies. The project documents successful smoke tests
with newer pandas, matplotlib, and seaborn combinations. EasyBuild's coherent
foss/2025a stack provides Python 3.13.1, NumPy 2.3.1, pandas 2.3.0, SciPy 1.16.0,
mpi4py 4.1.0, matplotlib 3.10.3, Seaborn 0.13.2, ParmEd, and tqdm 4.67.1.

Author: UCB HPC
